WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose your neckline template based
on the size you want your neckline to be.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.560
Now be sure to leave some room for your
bands, so make it wide enough so that you

3
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:15.440
have room for your bands and then
we'll just cut around this template.

4
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.640
I want to make my neckline
say 5 inches deep.

5
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.200
So let's say one, two, three, four, five.

6
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.520
I'm going to cut along
that five inch mark.

7
00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:43.680
And then just hold the template up to your
knitting and let's say that this is

8
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:48.440
blocked and we would have that top line
of the template along with the top edge

9
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:53.400
of the knitting. Take a marker and mark
around the outside of that curve.

10
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.320
So you have a nice, smooth curve.

11
00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:05.680
And you would use that for your cut 'n sew that line is where you would stitch
with the sewing machine or a serger.

12
00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.040
And then cut out that neckline
and complete your cut 'n sew

